  "setup_requirement": "Setup-stage checks only. Integration, scenario, `docker compose config` and image-build checks are NOT_CONFIGURED until compose.yaml, Dockerfiles and real-broker tests exist (milestone L3+); adding them is a trusted manual edit of this file followed by a restart and re-audit. Do not add placeholder passes."
